{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.IdentityIHLFBridge","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mathlib.IdentityIHLFBridge","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.SYTHookGNW","lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnumerationFintype","lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.RSKBurnsideTarget","lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityIContentDecomposition"],"declarations":3,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.rskBurnsideHolds_iff_dimHLF","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.rskBurnsideHolds_iff_dimHLF","kind":"theorem","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/IdentityIHLFBridge.lean#L62-L72","doc":"**`RSKBurnsideHolds` is now a computable statement.**  The abstract RSK/Burnside identity\n`Σ_{p ⊢ n} dimSYT(p)² = n!` (a sum of noncomputable `Nat.card`s) holds iff the corresponding\n`dimHLF` sum does — the form the `decide`-verified `n ≤ 12` Plancherel data\n(`IdentityIContentDecomposition.dim_validated_le12`, over the `partitionsOf` list enumerator)\ncomputes.  Discharging `RSKBurnsideHolds n` from that list-model data now needs only the\n`Nat.Partition n ↔ partitionsOf n` enumeration bridge, not any SYT structure theory. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.sum_dimSYT_sq_eq_sum_dimHLF_sq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.sum_dimSYT_sq_eq_sum_dimHLF_sq","kind":"theorem","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/IdentityIHLFBridge.lean#L55-L60","doc":"The RSK/Burnside sum over the genuine SYT counts equals the same sum over the computable\nhook-length dimensions — `dimSYT_eq_dimHLF` applied under `Σ_p`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.dimSYT_eq_dimHLF","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.dimSYT_eq_dimHLF","kind":"theorem","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/IdentityIHLFBridge.lean#L44-L53","doc":"**Hook-length bridge (proved).**  The genuine SYT count equals the Frame–Robinson–Thrall\nhook-length dimension of the partition's (weakly-decreasing) row-length list — the hook-length\nformula `#SYT(λ) = n!/∏_c h_c`.  Composition of the counting bridge\n`SYTEnum.dimSYT_eq_numSYTenum` with the general HLF `SYTEnum.numSYTenum_eq_dimHLF`\n(GNW corner recursion; positivity of the parts is `Nat.Partition.parts_pos`). ","signatureChunk":0}]}